{"2776770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blocks for Babies", "steam_appid": 2776770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Block Murder Roguelike</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/b05d0d72d55f5d53df4e75fe16ad19fc.poster.avif?t=1781948511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/b05d0d72d55f5d53df4e75fe16ad19fc.webm?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/b05d0d72d55f5d53df4e75fe16ad19fc.mp4?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks for Babies crosses roguelite block-stacking with first-person carnage. Form complete rows to <strong>clear lines in 2D</strong>, <strong>shoot to kill in 3D</strong>, and <strong>help Flapper clean up his blocks</strong> by any means necessary.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/9fe7acfe0e95d9a542ac7026001cd141.poster.avif?t=1781948511\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/9fe7acfe0e95d9a542ac7026001cd141.webm?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/9fe7acfe0e95d9a542ac7026001cd141.mp4?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>STACK</i> falling tetrominos</strong> in classic arcade style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SHOOT</i> and destroy blocks</strong> in first-person—fix mistakes, set up line clears, and fight the demonic horde</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover <i>SYNERGIES</i> </strong>with dozens of items, weapons, and upgrades to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face powerful <i>BOSSES</i> </strong>that will test your mastery of both modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your new <i>BEST FRIEND</i></strong>—help Flapper uncover the truth in a mysterious story told across multiple runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/c07d6d06a93d7b128c45b8fdffce3c79.poster.avif?t=1781948511\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/c07d6d06a93d7b128c45b8fdffce3c79.webm?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/c07d6d06a93d7b128c45b8fdffce3c79.mp4?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft a unique build with every roguelite run!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power up your stacking</strong> with unique abilities that trigger with each line clear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack the odds</strong> by altering pieces<i> before</i> they even drop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock and modify weapons</strong> to create the ultimate block-slaying arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experiment with new upgrades</strong> like passive perks, game-changing skills, and tactical gadgets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Keep getting stronger</strong> by purchasing persistent unlocks and rewards between runs  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/eb46efc77c893ddf0f3420324c866719.poster.avif?t=1781948511\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/eb46efc77c893ddf0f3420324c866719.webm?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/eb46efc77c893ddf0f3420324c866719.mp4?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable puzzle game. Brutal first-person shooter. With their powers combined, these disparate genres unlock a new dimension of gameplay satisfaction that has to be played to be believed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/5b5b8330d94dd5863a4885038f10c4e2.apng?t=1781948511\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/5b5b8330d94dd5863a4885038f10c4e2.poster.avif?t=1781948511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=546 height=546 /></picture></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Block Murder Roguelike</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/b05d0d72d55f5d53df4e75fe16ad19fc.poster.avif?t=1781948511\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/b05d0d72d55f5d53df4e75fe16ad19fc.webm?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/b05d0d72d55f5d53df4e75fe16ad19fc.mp4?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks for Babies crosses roguelite block-stacking with first-person carnage. Form complete rows to <strong>clear lines in 2D</strong>, <strong>shoot to kill in 3D</strong>, and <strong>help Flapper clean up his blocks</strong> by any means necessary.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/9fe7acfe0e95d9a542ac7026001cd141.poster.avif?t=1781948511\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/9fe7acfe0e95d9a542ac7026001cd141.webm?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/9fe7acfe0e95d9a542ac7026001cd141.mp4?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>STACK</i> falling tetrominos</strong> in classic arcade style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SHOOT</i> and destroy blocks</strong> in first-person—fix mistakes, set up line clears, and fight the demonic horde</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover <i>SYNERGIES</i> </strong>with dozens of items, weapons, and upgrades to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face powerful <i>BOSSES</i> </strong>that will test your mastery of both modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your new <i>BEST FRIEND</i></strong>—help Flapper uncover the truth in a mysterious story told across multiple runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/c07d6d06a93d7b128c45b8fdffce3c79.poster.avif?t=1781948511\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/c07d6d06a93d7b128c45b8fdffce3c79.webm?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/c07d6d06a93d7b128c45b8fdffce3c79.mp4?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft a unique build with every roguelite run!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power up your stacking</strong> with unique abilities that trigger with each line clear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack the odds</strong> by altering pieces<i> before</i> they even drop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock and modify weapons</strong> to create the ultimate block-slaying arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experiment with new upgrades</strong> like passive perks, game-changing skills, and tactical gadgets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Keep getting stronger</strong> by purchasing persistent unlocks and rewards between runs  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/eb46efc77c893ddf0f3420324c866719.poster.avif?t=1781948511\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776770/extras/eb46efc77c893ddf0f3420324c866719.webm?t=1781948511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=